heet\" href=\"css/later.css\"></head><body><main id=\"main\"><p id=\"source-order\">Source order and import</p><p id=\"specificity\" class=\"sample\" data-state=\"ready\">Specificity chain</p><p id=\"inline-important\" style=\"color:rgb(1,2,3);color:rgb(4,5,6)!important;border-top-color:rgb(1,2,3);margin-left:2px;margin-left:8px!important;padding-left:3px;padding-left:7px\">Inline important and repeated declarations</p><section id=\"nested\"><p id=\"descendant\" class=\"descendant\">Descendant selector</p></section><p id=\"child\" class=\"child\">Child selector</p><p id=\"attribute\" data-mark=\"attr\">Attribute selector</p><p id=\"not-target\" class=\"not-target\">Not selector</p><div id=\"group\"><span id=\"nth-first\">First child</span><span id=\"nth-second\">Second child</span><span id=\"nth-third\">Third child</span></div><p id=\"custom-property\">Custom property</p><p id=\"invalid-declaration\">Invalid declaration fallback</p><p id=\"unsupported-target\">Unsupported syntax fallback</p><p id=\"media-width\">Viewport media query</p><p id=\"media-scheme\">Color scheme media query</p><a id=\"probe-anchor\" href=\"#media-width\">Anchor target</a><form id=\"raw-controls\"><input id=\"probe-input\" value=\"input\"><button id=\"probe-button\" type=\"button\">Button</button></form></main></body></html>",
